Description: Posture monitoring service for Praya
 Praya Posture monitors your posture using your webcam and sends
 desktop notifications when slouching is detected.
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time posture detection using MediaPipe
  - Desktop notifications via D-Bus
  - Configurable tolerance settings
  - GNOME Shell extension support via D-Bus API
 .
 This is part of the Praya modular wellness platform.
